        "@value": "Rauschenberg\u2019s notebook, with additional notes by Brice Marden and others (presumably Rauschenberg\u2019s studio staff). Includes performance notes, diagrams, and memos."
      },
      {
        "@value": "Also includes a draft of a note to Steve Mark about contacting Robert Kennedy to inform him of a press conference taking place at his Lafayette St. studio on Oct 10th, announcing E.A.T.\u2019s partnerships between artists and the science and technology field, 1967. Creator: Robert Rauschenberg, Brice [Marden], and unidentified."
      }
