    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: co-founder Robert Whitman on the volunteers and engineers of 9 Evenings, his piece Two Holes of Water, the founding of E.A.T. with Billy Kl\u00fcver and Fred Waldhauer, and the mirror dome and programming of the Pepsi Pavilion."
      }
