    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T. projects: Brice Marden, then Rauschenberg's assistant, on folding the plastic tunnels of Steve Paxton's 9 Evenings piece, on the engineers' work for Soundings and Solstice, and on installing Soundings in Cologne."
      }
