    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Toshi Ichiyanagi says he reached New York just after 9 Evenings at the Armory in autumn 1966 and missed it, but heard much about the event and about Billy Kl\u00fcver of Bell Laboratories."
      }
